   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794035722186,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. API + 16-task subset, tested with a simulated executor\n2. Async jobs: Postgres queue, leases, resume after crash\n3. Sandboxes: one E2B microVM per task, agent in a locked-down runner\n4. Loop: real failures \u2192 LLM proposes one fix \u2192 validate \u2192 re-run \u2192 keep if better\n5. Tenancy (orgs, roles), one real E2B run, README + PR",
   "originalText": "1. API + 16-task subset, tested with a simulated executor\n2. Async jobs: Postgres queue, leases, resume after crash\n3. Sandboxes: one E2B microVM per task, agent in a locked-down runner\n4. Loop: real failures \u2192 LLM proposes one fix \u2192 validate \u2192 re-run \u2192 keep if better\n5. Tenancy (orgs, roles), one real E2B run, README + PR",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
